  [PASS] A1-5  DUST is LINEAR in the charge I_0, STIFF is QUADRATIC in I_0 -- one perfect square, exactly the repo's L84/L87 structure (dust ~ A*C, stiff ~ C^2), here in the PUBLISHED theory

